  <reporting-org ref="XM-DAC-47066" type="40">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Organization for Migration (IOM)</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Providing Refugee Resettlement Assistance to the Government of Portugal for 2020-2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will contribute towards the provision of a durable solution to 1729 beneficiaries of international protection in Egypt, Turkey, and Jordan by facilitating their resettlement to Portugal in 2020-2022. To this end, IOM will facilitate the selection mission and visa processing in Jordan, perform pre-migration health activities, conduct pre-departure orientation sessions to refugees before their travel, and manage all beneficiaries&apos; movements to Portugal. Upon arrival, IOM will also provide early integration assistance to reception communities to support local actors involved in the reception and integration of refugees. The project will ensure monitoring of all activities throughout their implementation period.</narrative>
  </description>
